  "description": {
    "text": "The deck with Bulbasaur from the Master Kit, released on 15 July 2005: two ready-built 15-card decks, 12 sideboard cards for changing them, a coin, damage counters and markers, a playmat, a how-to-play book and a CD-ROM. The CD-ROM taught the flow of a game, held a card encyclopedia of about 3,600 cards from the very first set to the Golden Sky, Silvery Ocean expansion, and had a deck builder for every card from the ADV series on.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: 「マスターキット」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090226205056/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/pcg/pcg_25.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
      }
    ]
  },
